 {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["这是一张在户外花园拍摄的年轻女性的写真照片。照片中的女孩有着乌黑亮丽的长发，几缕发丝被风吹拂，显得自然灵动。她面带微笑，眼神清澈，嘴唇涂有淡粉色口红，整体气质清新甜美。\n\n她身穿一套粉色与橙色相间的格纹短款外套和短裙，风格时尚且充满青春活力。内搭一件白色的吊带背心，凸显出纤细的腰身。外套和短裙的面料看起来是粗花呢材质，带有精致的编织纹理，袖口和裙摆处有毛边设计，增添了一丝俏皮感。\n\n她的脖子上戴着一条细巧的项链，手腕上佩戴着两条不同款式的银色手链，显得精致又不失休闲感。女孩微微俯身，双手自然地放在身前，姿态优雅。\n\n背景是一片绿意盎然的草坪，周围点缀着五彩缤纷的花朵，有橙色、粉色和白色的雏菊等，阳光透过树叶洒下斑驳的光影，营造出温暖、明媚的氛围。整张照片色彩明亮，构图和谐，展现了女孩在自然美景中的青春与活力。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 16, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [785.87744140625, 598.1935424804688], "pos": [2003.63720703125, -239.07180786132812], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [15, 16], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["用中文描述图像", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1143, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 13, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name"